# skills.pdl - SKILL rows (design section 3): the act menu is generated from the skills an entity has (stored, or implied by a held item) and whose needs_item it holds.
# needs_place is a label in v0 (no map: every place is present, see README gaps); cost_ticks is informational (one act per day); event= names the page/verb that performs it.
SKILL | plant   | needs_item=seed | needs_place=field | cost_ticks=1 | event=eden_plant
SKILL | water   | needs_item=jug  | needs_place=field | cost_ticks=1 | event=eden_water
SKILL | collect | needs_item=hoe  | needs_place=field | cost_ticks=1 | event=eden_collect
SKILL | eat     | cost_ticks=1 | event=eden_eat
SKILL | rest    | cost_ticks=1 | event=eden_rest
SKILL | trade   | cost_ticks=1 | event=eden_trade
SKILL | talk    | cost_ticks=1 | event=eden_talk
SKILL | build   | needs_item=hoe | needs_place=field | cost_ticks=1 | event=eden_build
SKILL | study   | cost_ticks=1 | event=eden_study
